  "features": [
    "HTTPS adapters forward ALPNProtocols and use the existing TLS normalization helper for array and encoded-buffer forms.",
    "HTTP server SSL_CTX installs a static protocol-list selector using server-owned config storage; negotiated values reach the resource timeline.",
    "Valid preference-list, encoded-buffer and reused-connection controls pass with certificate verification enabled."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Dynamic ALPN callbacks, SNI context handoff, reload/reconfiguration, encoding/length edge semantics and broader lifecycle/platform coverage remain open in #875/#532.",
